3) the two dynasties: the React key space is unique
   (weaker than section 2 on purpose: neither dynasty engine reads a player id,
    so a duplicate there is a rendering defect rather than a lost player. It is
    held anyway because a cut button keyed on p.id would inherit section 2's bug.)
   CFB Dynasty: every roster's keys are unique and no recruit collides with one
   CBB Dynasty: every roster's keys are unique and no recruit collides with one

simEngineIds: an id minted in one page load cannot collide with one minted in another, in all six engines.
